  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"11.0.1\"\n  major_minor: ${{ (version | split('.'))[:2] | join('.') }}\n\npackage:\n  name: cyclonedds-cxx\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds-cxx/archive/refs/tags/${{ version }}.tar.gz \n  sha256: f20d30610100329716b2bd810054741a6ce9be6a9eeefcf941def1e1b311ddb2\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - cmake\n    - ninja\n    - if: build_platform != target_platform\n      then:\n        - cyclonedds ${{ major_minor }}.*\n  host:\n    - cyclonedds ${{ major_minor }}.*\n  run:\n    - cyclonedds ${{ major_minor }}.*\n  run_exports:\n    - ${{ pin_subpackage('cyclonedds-cxx', upper_bound='x.x') }}\n\ntests:\n  - package_contents:\n      include:\n        - ddscxx/dds/dds.hpp\n      files:\n        - if: unix\n          then:\n            - lib/cmake/CycloneDDS-CXX/CycloneDDS-CXXConfig.cmake\n          else:\n            - Library/lib/cmake/CycloneDDS-CXX/CycloneDDS-CXXConfig.cmake\n      lib:\n        - ddscxx\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://cyclonedds.io\n  summary: C++ binding for Eclipse Cyclone DDS\n  description: |\n    An implementation of the ISO/IEC C++ PSM, or simply put, a C++ binding for \n    Eclipse Cyclone DDS. Cyclone DDS is developed completely in the open as an \n    Eclipse IoT project (see eclipse-cyclone-dds) with a growing list of adopters \n    (if you're one of them, please add your logo).\n    It is a tier-1 middleware for the Robot Operating System ROS 2.\n  license: EPL-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  documentation: https://cyclonedds.io/docs/cyclonedds-cxx/latest/\n  repository: https://github.com/eclipse-cyclonedds/cyclonedds-cxx\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - nmarticorena\n",
